[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Lift the front of the car.</p><p>1. Undo the wheelarch bolts.</p><p>2. Using the special tool, remove the retaining buttons.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Scraper blade</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.878.077.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Prise off and remove the additional wheelarch.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035862.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the wheelarch is\nundamaged.</p><p>Fit the additional wheelarch.</p><p>Fit the retaining buttons.</p><p>Tighten the screws.</p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p>"]]